@baseUrl = http://localhost:9000
@apiKey = REEMPLAZAR_API_KEY
@token = REEMPLAZAR_JWT
@appId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Login (copiar accessToken)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"userName":"admin","password":"REEMPLAZAR_CONTRASENA","appId":"{{appId}}"}

### Sesión actual
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Roles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/roles?skip=0&take=25
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear rol
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/roles
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Supervisor"}

### Crear usuario (rol Operator de la semilla)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"userName":"operador1","password":"REEMPLAZAR-CONTRASENA-LARGA","roleId":"10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002","isActive":true}

### Asignar Roulette (reemplazar userId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user-apps
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId":"REEMPLAZAR_USER_ID","appId":"20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002"}

### Consultar aplicaciones
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/apps
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### PUT requiere la version devuelta por GET. DELETE usa ?version=GUID.
